    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】16：极速焕彩",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-indent: 21pt; line-height: normal; overflow-x: auto; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">极速焕彩</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 20.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">1. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">赛事背景</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">在智能手机、车载显示和车载流媒体等实时图像处理场景中，对高清输入图像进行快速、精准的色彩风格化或色彩校正是一项核心需求，满足用户多样化的拍照体验。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">赛题任务</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">系统输入一张</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">RGB</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">图和</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">个三维颜色空间，该图的像素</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">RGB</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">值作为输入坐标，在给定的颜色空间中查找计算得到目标值，参赛选手需要设计并实现一个色彩空间稀疏化算法和图像色彩映射算法，首先从三维色彩映射空间（</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">256*256*256</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">）维度稀疏化到</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m*m*m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">，</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">限制为（</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">17 &lt;= m &lt;= 33</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">），然后在稀疏色彩空间中计算出像素的映射值，在满足特定色差精度限制的前提下，经过</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">次颜色空间映射，输出最终的图像结果。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">每个像素的计算步骤：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">将给定的三维色彩空间</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">LUT</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">稀疏化到</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m*m*m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">晶体空间，稀疏化算法由选手设计实现</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">确定输入像素在晶体空间位置（立方体）</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">在立方体通过插值算法求出目标值</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">C</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">，插值算法由选手设计实现</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">以上完成了单个像素色彩空间的映射，计算共需要完成</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">次映射，分别对应</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">个颜色空间，完成所有的颜色的映射调整。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689933210931200.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-0qmvyzrn8dfrupwqokjz22htlw9fdbmp-0-b6a39a4f3cf705aa20aca08186b4e5309af6c4a5600f69d3daae7f7c135a40f5&translate_time=1791441269\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">输入数据规格</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">）输入图像规格</span><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">图像分辨率</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">1024 × 768 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">像素</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">图像格式</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">RGB 3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">通道彩色图</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">位深</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：每通道</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 8-bit </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">量化（像素值范围</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 0 ~ 255</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">）</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">）输入色彩空间规格</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">LUT</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">规格：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">256*256*256</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">LUT</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">数量：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">个</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">LUT</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">变量类型：整型</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">选手输出件：</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">提供稀疏算法完成颜色空间从</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">256*256*256</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">到</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m*m*m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">稀疏化处理</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">提供查找和插值算法，完成输入图像像素在稀疏颜色空间的映射计算</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">变换约束与定义</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ol style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">色彩映射</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：每一步色彩映射均在稀疏化空间</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m*m*m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">中完成，且</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m*m*m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">空间与原色彩空间变量类型一致，</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">m</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">约束为（</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">17 &lt;= m &lt;= 33</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">）。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">多级串联</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：输入图像必须通过</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">次独立且不同的色彩映射调整，</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">次色彩映射可以依次顺序通过，也可以做等价计算优化次数，每次映射变化的输入</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">输出约束均为整型变量，与最终计算结果输出类型一致。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">联合优化：</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">稀疏化算法可以与查找</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">插值算法联合优化设计，达到精度和速度最优；</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; margin: 24.0pt 0cm 24.0pt 0cm;\"><hr style=\"; text-align: center;\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; margin: 24.0pt 0cm 24.0pt 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">3. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">核心限制与技术引导</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">矩阵稀疏化与压缩</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：选手需要设计稀疏化方案（如稀疏采样、矩阵低秩分解、基函数拟合等），在降低内存占用的同时保证插值效率。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">技术路线不设限</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：允许并鼓励使用传统并行加速算法（如</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> CUDA </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">优化、多线程插值、</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">SIMD</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">指令集）或轻量化</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> AI </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">算法（如感知器拟合、超轻量神经网络、网络剪枝）。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">精度硬约束</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：输出图像与理论标准变换图像之间，必须满足色差公式约束：</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; layout-grid-mode: line;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689931839373312.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-98atzz8pqs1lcxkw6j8zr52nm1m6twll-0-bcc58bd0339389bce88e28ab0861b46192536cd8e00e5665b855fe1e643a35fe\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">注：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; layout-grid-mode: line;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689931646435328.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-bf1parnc45gmfmyseohntb0vqa1w8vxo-0-c01bf0f1e40c25329121f4c50693b5665887e201dd83ee63df2aaf78f541f317\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">为总色差，</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">Threshold </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">赛题组将在测试集发布时统一公布，用以过滤低质量退化图像</span><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">)</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; layout-grid-mode: line;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689931596124160.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-ukutv4qs5qf4qmgnwlomd7bw9yrgvykx-0-6d8092ca5d2a4aad496bc282d4919c2a4f2d95f86cfde7f65e5de5f01eefe500\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">计算方法为：</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; layout-grid-mode: line;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689931759681536.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-8hhr3jlir3xvykjimofwllkdcqk2hxcn-0-0c2189a6fcfb753c0e752a72389913cfff47786e1283c7c3dbe53ce11f9500c9\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><i><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"></span></i></p>\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\">https://snki.nl/en/blogs/kleurverschilformules-uitgelegd-cie76-cmc-cie94-ciede2000</span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; margin: 24.0pt 0cm 24.0pt 0cm;\"><hr style=\"; text-align: center;\"></div>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; margin: 24.0pt 0cm 24.0pt 0cm;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">4. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">评估指标与评分标准</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">评测将从</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">正确性</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">、<b>运行速度</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">和</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> </span><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">内存占用</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">三个维度进行综合考量，总分</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 100 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">分。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">A. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">算法正确性与精度（硬门槛，通过得</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 40 </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">分）</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">选手的输出图像必须完全通过</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; layout-grid-mode: line;\"> <img src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326689931688378368.png?state=2&auth_key=1791441248-oquhkplxnsvk8gckkteo680ukkmifvog-0-5dff56eb2f4f8c3bb4bd5a6373ba6ec337f0efd25edd728ffd1e5f6384fc8c58\" style=\"; vertical-align: middle;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">的硬性阈值约束。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">若单张图片未能通过约束，则该图片计为</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 0 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">分。整个测试集平均色差越低，此项得分越高。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">B. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">执行速度（性能核心，</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">40 </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">分）</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">评测环境</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：统一在指定配置的服务器上运行。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">吞吐量测试</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：计算算法处理</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">100</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">张图像完成</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"> 4 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">次色彩变换的平均耗时如在</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700@2.1G</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">通用</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">CPU</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">下单张图像处理耗时应在</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">1.5s</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">以下。耗时最短的队伍获得满分，其余队伍按比例得分。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">C. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">架构与算法创新性（</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\">20 </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">分）</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></b></p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\">\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">内存与工程优化</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：考察映射矩阵的稀疏化压缩比、高效插值计算方法等。</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: normal; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">代码架构</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; layout-grid-mode: both;\">：考量代码的工程落地可行性，是否便于移植到嵌入式或移动端设备</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; layout-grid-mode: both;\"></span></li>\n</ul>",
